# Platinum opening, part 1: new game to the Route 201 rival's challenge (opening.replay goes on with the
# battle; m2-first-battle-lost.replay loses it). The opening as a whole: new game to the Lake Verity Cyrus scene (docs/research/scripts-and-opening.md §5–6).
# Inputs and asserts only (no ROM content). Runs headless in tests/integration/opening.rom.test.ts
# against a pack imported from OPENSINNOH_NDS_ROM, seed 1. Messages are answered with A, yes/no with yes,
# the starter scene with right, right, A (Piplup; the browser spec taps the ball instead of the
# "starter key" lines). Grammar: packages/core/src/replay.ts.
# Inputs wait on the game (`until …`, `advance text`); walks hold a
# direction `until position`, running with B held; `+N` only follows a sync point (re-timed from a
# recording with tools/replays/retime.ts). Runs headless, also started late and on other seeds, in
# tests/integration/checkpoints.rom.test.ts. Screenshot lines are the browser spec's beats: mid-scene,
# `+N` after the input that started the scene.
# Every battle is real: wild encounters on the way are fought by the waits with the `battle auto`
# policy (`wild auto`), trainer battles with explicit `battle auto` lines.
+0 wild auto
# Piplup's evolution is stopped with B wherever it comes up (`evolve cancel`): the checkpoints keep
# the Piplup they were recorded with (docs/decisions.md).
+0 evolve cancel
